    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d211">

                <pb facs="0279" n="209" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv01/pg209"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 184/66</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Commission to Negotiate Peace</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to Mr. William C. Bullitt
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-23">December 23,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In pursuance of a memorandum submitted by Dr. Mezes to Mr. Grew and
                    approved by the Commission, you have been appointed Chief of the division
                    entitled Current Intelligence Summaries, one of the divisions of that section of
                    the American Commission to Negotiate Peace entitled Territorial, Economic and
                    Political Intelligence.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
